Marked content that was empty in the source survives filtering.

The sanitize filter holds each BMC or BDC back until something is
sent inside it, and drops it at its EMC otherwise. A sequence that
was empty to begin with (`/Artifact BMC EMC`, or only state between)
was dropped too, by every edit that rewrites a page through the
filter (Ely moving or rewriting text, redaction). The filter now
counts what it removes; a tag that lost nothing is sent at its EMC.

